                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3346a398-534d-3762-8107-a7e5d2b649d5",
                        "entry_id": "b6ac1556-b709-33f4-bab1-1d15c9d1be24",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Spiel, das hauptsächlich mit Zahlen zu tun hat"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "589f1f68-b711-4049-b3f2-7335b6a98a47",
                                "sense_id": "3346a398-534d-3762-8107-a7e5d2b649d5",
                                "text": "Heute spielen wir ein Zahlenspiel."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a634394-351a-4963-975a-4fd0c9f608e1",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6ac1556-b709-33f4-bab1-1d15c9d1be24",
                        "source_sense_id": "3346a398-534d-3762-8107-a7e5d2b649d5",
                        "source_sense_description": "Spiel, das hauptsächlich mit Zahlen zu tun hat",
                        "target_lang_word": "numbers game",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "numbers game",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c7819de-65d4-3217-a3c8-9d85840474e2",
                                        "entry_id": "3ca14086-b7c7-34a1-bff8-b076eef36430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lottery in which bettors attempt to guess which numbers will later be drawn randomly; especially, an illicit one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0327ccdb-3a67-488d-a0de-35d72bc85a64",
                                                "sense_id": "5c7819de-65d4-3217-a3c8-9d85840474e2",
                                                "text": "Back in that day, mafias ran the numbers games and there was no such thing as a state lottery."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d01fe39-4ef3-3f74-b7bc-1b8969ce369f",
                                        "entry_id": "3ca14086-b7c7-34a1-bff8-b076eef36430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The incorrect use of statistics (numbers) to reflect a desired result (usually misleading)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f71be5af-6deb-4964-bc2d-d077aff1a47b",
                                                "sense_id": "7d01fe39-4ef3-3f74-b7bc-1b8969ce369f",
                                                "text": "They're playing a numbers game to make it look like seat belts and vaccines are dangerous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff8d7362-001f-4e71-a2fc-4f837beac368",
                                                "sense_id": "7d01fe39-4ef3-3f74-b7bc-1b8969ce369f",
                                                "text": "Is it not as misleading to apply a simple numbers game to the Civil Service as it is to the police?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f22adbc1-b8df-45c0-9075-65d22c1e7ef2",
                                                "sense_id": "7d01fe39-4ef3-3f74-b7bc-1b8969ce369f",
                                                "text": "The Secretary of State was quick to mention the problems of the 1960s and the 1970s. He criticised the quick-build policies pursued then. He later threw in the 1950s as well. That was when the numbers game was all. We see today the results of playing the numbers game."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f00b14c5-4e81-4b52-b9a6-69b98e5465c5",
                                                "sense_id": "7d01fe39-4ef3-3f74-b7bc-1b8969ce369f",
                                                "text": "Mr. John Powley (Norwich, South): The hon. Member for Newham, North-West (Mr. Banks) was careful to say that at any one time no more than four GLC officers were present in the Committee. He did not say that only four had ever been present. Is it not possible that, through the long hours, relays of four different people at different times have been involved in the argument?\nMr. Martin Stevens: That is what is called playing the numbers game. I do no more than thank my hon. Friend for his kind intervention."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43c17c4c-18b4-44df-a2cd-5a08147f584f",
                                                "sense_id": "7d01fe39-4ef3-3f74-b7bc-1b8969ce369f",
                                                "text": "I made it clear in a recent letter to the Minister, to which I do not expect him to reply tonight, that we will not play the numbers game of setting targets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8311beec-4847-3013-aadf-a1311c9f9132",
                                        "entry_id": "3ca14086-b7c7-34a1-bff8-b076eef36430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An activity that benefits from having many things to work with or on; a focus on quantity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8958e39e-bdc4-40c4-9842-28a04680b066",
                                                "sense_id": "8311beec-4847-3013-aadf-a1311c9f9132",
                                                "text": "In this business, breakeven is a numbers game: if you can achieve enough volume, you'll be all right."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c40e660a-7c97-4ae0-9bc3-c572cbcea0fc",
                                                "sense_id": "8311beec-4847-3013-aadf-a1311c9f9132",
                                                "text": "If dating is, as Match.com's Trish McDermott puts it, “a number's game^([sic])”, there can be no denying that the numbers are increased online. The speed and affordability of these services are further attractions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f00330c4-c9b1-4984-8849-a9526439bd5b",
                                                "sense_id": "8311beec-4847-3013-aadf-a1311c9f9132",
                                                "text": "Plant breeding is always a numbers game.[…]The wild species we use are rich in genetic variation, and individual plants are highly heterozygous and do not breed true. In addition, we are looking for rare alleles, so the more plants we try, the better."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09ad7101-3b3a-4404-8e6d-2f2f7d1950a2",
                                                "sense_id": "8311beec-4847-3013-aadf-a1311c9f9132",
                                                "text": "At the same time, if you’re chasing the mobile pennies that replaced the digital dimes that replaced the print dollars, then the numbers game becomes more important than ever. Mobile publishing is a big-company game, and the big companies playing it are filling their newsrooms with “growth editors” and data scientists and “audience development” experts, all of whom basically have one job: maximise traffic, by any means necessary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "878471da-3f55-4994-ae23-607408e99f69",
                                                "sense_id": "8311beec-4847-3013-aadf-a1311c9f9132",
                                                "text": "Which means that men playing a high-numbers game actually risk being bad in bed because they’re just doing the same things all the time, just with different women and not “developing their repertoire”, as it were."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18b2f99c-a535-3799-a970-22c1ad640428",
                                        "entry_id": "3ca14086-b7c7-34a1-bff8-b076eef36430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game or sport that is dominated by analytics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22d49438-bee2-4456-9973-550cd712ad77",
                                                "sense_id": "18b2f99c-a535-3799-a970-22c1ad640428",
                                                "text": "Somehow, to me, it's not quite as fun now that they've turned it into a numbers game."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a3a50dc-c778-41b5-9953-ec663599dfe6",
                                                "sense_id": "18b2f99c-a535-3799-a970-22c1ad640428",
                                                "text": "Is rugby union losing its way by becoming a numbers game? [title]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
